            "text": "<p>Consider:</p><pre><code>void g(int x) {\n  if (x == 42) bug();   // branch B1\n}</code></pre><p>The run starts with <code>x = 7</code> (so B1 is false, PC is <code>x \u2260 42</code>). What next input does negating B1 yield?</p>",
